","semantic_limit":"Pressure-system requirements do not establish a written scheme, examination result or equipment condition.","evidence_fingerprint_sha256":"6f926bcb7205380bb08a80f10b39580e22baf686493e69f0ddf5a843dfb94853"},{"line":606,"source_id":"SRC-606","name":"Pressure systems: A brief guide to safety","publisher":"Health and Safety Executive","authority_accuracy":99,"decision":"promoted_pressure_systems_brief_guard","official_url":"https://www.hse.gov.uk/pubns/indg261.htm","evidence_date":"2012-01-01","freshness_status":"verified_2026-07-23_official_primary_source","semantic_limit":"General pressure hazard guidance is not evidence of stored-energy risk at a named property or workplace.","evidence_fingerprint_sha256":"c1630da9832ade17c706040b9016689f1b476c0056e2795cdb125805b6e7f437"},{"line":607,"source_id":"SRC-607","name":"Safe use of work equipment","publisher":"Health and Safety Executive","authority_accuracy":99,"decision":"promoted_puwer_acop_methodology","official_url":"https://www.hse.gov.uk/pubns/books/l22.htm","evidence_date":"2018-01-01","freshness_status":"verified_2026-07-23_official_primary_source","semantic_limit":"PUWER guidance is control methodology and not evidence about the suitability or maintenance of specific equipment.","evidence_fingerprint_sha256":"a984256fdde13e19fa9476544b3b18d7e663de0e235c49087269fa24efdd0e70"},{"line":608,"source_id":"SRC-608","name":"Provision and Use of Work Equipment Regulations 1998 (PUWER) - overview","publisher":"Health and Safety Executive","authority_accuracy":99,"decision":"promoted_puwer_regulatory_scope_guard","official_url":"https://www.hse.gov.uk/work-equipment-machinery/puwer-overview.htm","evidence_date":"2026-07-23","freshness_status":"verified_2026-07-23_official_primary_source","semantic_limit":"The overview explains duties but cannot establish inspection, guarding, training or maintenance at a workplace.","evidence_fingerprint_sha256":"8030c51520ecde9be130091b3ff9b5361fb7b77c785901d5f4888e4c1766ab92"},{"line":609,"source_id":"SRC-609","name":"Providing and using work equipment safely","publisher":"Health and Safety Executive","authority_accuracy":98,"decision":"promoted_work_equipment_brief_methodology","official_url":"https://www.hse.gov.uk/pubns/indg291.htm","evidence_date":"2013-01-01","freshness_status":"verified_2026-07-23_official_primary_source","semantic_limit":"The brief guide is not machine-level inspection or operating evidence.","evidence_fingerprint_sha256":"2dd87f58e8abf6a10399cbe6069a5be209c27c8124ad8165014784909e08399d"},{"line":610,"source_id":"SRC-610","name":"Introduction to working in confined spaces","publisher":"Health and Safety Executive","authority_accuracy":99,"decision":"promoted_confined_space_hazard_methodology","official_url":"https://www.hse.gov.uk/confinedspace/introduction.htm","evidence_date":"2026-07-23","freshness_status":"verified_2026-07-23_official_primary_source","semantic_limit":"Hazard and planning guidance does not identify a parcel as containing a confined space or prove its controls.","evidence_fingerprint_sha256":"019bf54b6d4b8560cf54ef4a4cb7e710363fe3f94b7ea6695692e8dc1c1849ce"},{"line":611,"source_id":"SRC-611","name":"Health and safety guidance and compliance","publisher":"Office of Rail and Road","authority_accuracy":99,"decision":"promoted_rail_regulatory_series_guard","official_url":"https://www.orr.gov.uk/rail-guidance-compliance/health-safety","evidence_date":"2026-07-23","freshness_status":"verified_2026-07-23_official_primary_source","semantic_limit":"The regulatory landing page supports rail-safety framework QA and is not operator or location performance evidence.","evidence_fingerprint_sha256":"0973f269c4fbcb7187fa4d46dee92b7e0ca89d6351c408d979b5032f24478af0"},{"line":612,"source_id":"SRC-612","name":"Health and safety guidance","publisher":"Office of Rail and Road","authority_accuracy":98,"decision":"held_rail_guidance_collection","official_url":"https://www.orr.gov.uk/health-and-safety/health-and-safety-guidance","evidence_date":"2026-07-14","freshness_status":"verified_2026-07-23_official_primary_source","semantic_limit":"The publication collection is held as an index; individual strategic chapters require separate semantic review.","evidence_fingerprint_sha256":"4a164804b39e928093dad073ff4c2dc4f16941524ec3d25e96f3ec4b0be4322b"},{"line":613,"source_id":"SRC-613","name":"Annual report of health and safety on Britain’s railways 2025 to 2026","publisher":"Office of Rail and Road","authority_accuracy":99,"decision":"held_rail_sector_performance_report","official_url":"https://www.orr.gov.uk/annual-report-health-and-safety-britains-railways-2025-2026","evidence_date":"2026-07-14","freshness_status":"verified_2026-07-23_official_primary_source","semantic_limit":"Sector performance and enforcement findings are aggregate context and are not parcel or station scores.","evidence_fingerprint_sha256":"e17c0ba181b7aff0081d7e04c3dfa8d578ad332b23c97c0600547957f28f5ae3"},{"line":614,"source_id":"SRC-614","name":"Annual health and safety reports","publisher":"Office of Rail and Road","authority_accuracy":98,"decision":"held_rail_annual_report_collection","official_url":"https://www.orr.gov.uk/monitoring-regulation/rail/promoting-health-safety/annual-health-safety-reports","evidence_date":"2026-07-14","freshness_status":"verified_2026-07-23_official_primary_source","semantic_limit":"The report series is held as a collection and does not create a separate local risk observation.","evidence_fingerprint_sha256":"c0d5e33f693e7a309f0508549e276d91eaefe2a3e40d12e81bf0d8471911db07"},{"line":615,"source_id":"SRC-615","name":"Managing safety when investing in the rail network","publisher":"Office of Rail and Road","authority_accuracy":99,"decision":"promoted_rail_change_risk_methodology","official_url":"https://www.orr.gov.uk/monitoring-regulation/rail/investing-rail-network/managing-safety","evidence_date":"2026-07-23","freshness_status":"verified_2026-07-23_official_primary_source","semantic_limit":"Safety-management and change-assessment expectations are methodology, not evidence about a named scheme.","evidence_fingerprint_sha256":"ad4d9037efc91f16344b25b0c2a65eb801fe52050571a16f860ac4c242a2339f"},{"line":616,"source_id":"SRC-616","name":"Minor and heritage railways","publisher":"Office of Rail and Road","authority_accuracy":99,"decision":"promoted_minor_heritage_rail_sms_methodology","official_url":"https://www.orr.gov.uk/guidance-compliance/rail/health-safety/strategy/minor-and-heritage-railways","evidence_date":"2026-07-14","freshness_status":"verified_2026-07-23_official_primary_source","semantic_limit":"Proportionate SMS guidance is not performance evidence for a named heritage or minor railway.","evidence_fingerprint_sha256":"5eac7ed3a950865fb43401b3f57d8c2f81201cccde5bae86a757370091f41f35"},{"line":617,"source_id":"SRC-617","name":"Health and safety management","publisher":"Office of Rail and Road","authority_accuracy":99,"decision":"promoted_rail_sms_strategic_methodology","official_url":"https://www.orr.gov.uk/health-and-safety-management","evidence_date":"2026-07-23","freshness_status":"verified_2026-07-23_official_primary_source","semantic_limit":"Strategic risk expectations support management-system QA and are not operator-specific maturity findings.","evidence_fingerprint_sha256":"b892c3f25f5de0064e463636d19768aed4f1f4b19aaf6258d98b066b32336f43"},{"line":618,"source_id":"SRC-618","name":"ORR strategy for regulation of health and safety risks: Level crossings","publisher":"Office of Rail and Road","authority_accuracy":98,"decision":"promoted_level_crossing_risk_methodology","official_url":"https://www.orr.gov.uk/media/11000","evidence_date":"2025-05-30","freshness_status":"verified_2026-07-23_official_primary_source","semantic_limit":"Strategic level-crossing methodology does not establish risk or controls at a named crossing.","evidence_fingerprint_sha256":"0e297123fed5259a1f9d0dfcc045644606d838b241fc80bcad6d8a11fa19711a"},{"li